The diff does add both `margin-left: auto;` and `@include order(3);` to `.panel` in `header.scss` (".panel { ... margin-left: auto;

      @include order(3); }"). But these do not “encode the same intent”: `margin-left:auto` pushes the flex item to the right within the flex line, while `order(3)` changes the item’s ordering among siblings. Also, the claimed cross-file coupling to `topic.scss` is not evidenced: `topic.scss` only adds `@include order(2);` to `.extra-info-wrapper` and does not reference `.panel` or header layout at all (".extra-info-wrapper {
+  @include order(2); }").

